New sidebar menu item under 리포트 that lets a rep pick a company and
generate an AI meeting-prep brief from real pipeline data instead of
a bare "만들어줘" prompt.

- New view (meetingPrep) with a company search, a 선택한 기업 정보
  panel, a 타겟 제품별 현황 list per deal, and a merged 과거 히스토리
  timeline pulled from existing deals/activityLog data already loaded
  client-side.
- Meeting-purpose quick-select buttons (첫 미팅/후속 미팅/제품 제안/
  PoC/계약·예산/관계 재활성화) plus a free-text box for extra context,
  matching the structure from the shared reference doc.
- New /api/meeting-brief route: pulls the selected company's deals +
  activity via the Admin SDK, assembles the structured sections
  (기본정보/제품별 히스토리/전체 이력/미결사항), and calls Claude with
  a fixed 9-section report template. No external news source is wired
  up yet, so the prompt explicitly tells the model to say so rather
  than inventing news.
- Lightweight inline markdown renderer (renderBriefMarkdown) for the
  report preview, plus 복사/PDF 출력 (reusing the existing print-area
  pattern from the quote generator) — no new dependency added.

